Search engines that scrape multiple sites (Google, Yahoo, Bing, Goo, etc) at the same time and return results.

Carrot2 (Free) - https://search.carrot2.org/  
Metasearch tool that organizes search results into topic-based clusters.

Zapmeta (Free) - http://www.zapmeta.com/  
Metasearch engine that combines results from multiple search sources.
